### 3. Get single university (as super admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/universities/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4. Get single university WITHOUT auth (should fail — 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/universities/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### 5. Create a new university (super admin only — should succeed 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/universities
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "University of Douala",
  "shortCode": "UD",
  "matriculePrefix": "UD",
  "isActive": true
}

### 6. Create university with duplicate name (should fail — 409 NAME_TAKEN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/universities
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "University of Bamenda",
  "shortCode": "UBX",
  "matriculePrefix": "UBX"
}

### 7. Create university with bad prefix (should fail — 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/universities
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bad Prefix Uni",
  "shortCode": "BPU",
  "matriculePrefix": "U1"
}

### 8. Create university as CC (should fail — 403 FORBIDDEN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/universities
Authorization: Bearer {{ccToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Forbidden Uni",
  "shortCode": "FU",
  "matriculePrefix": "FU"
}

### 9. Update university (toggle is_active to false)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/universities/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### 10. Verify it disappears from public list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/universities

### 11. But visible to super admin (includeInactive)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/universities
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 12. Restore University of Buea (is_active back to true)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/universities/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": true
}

### 13. Get non-existent university (should fail — 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/universities/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 14. Invalid UUID in path (should fail — 422)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/universities/not-a-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}